<title>USA: Park City BOE, Utah won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Park City BOE, Utah won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings said it won $10 million of Park City Board of Education, Utah, general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
</text>
